{
  "id": "dev-acl",
  "language": "typescript",
  "kind": "existing",
  "split": "development",
  "title": "Access-rule precedence",
  "trigger": "active_check",
  "requirements": [
    "data 含 path 字符串和 rules 数组，每条规则含 prefix 和 allow 布尔值。匹配前缀；初始采用第一条匹配规则，缺省拒绝。",
    "修复当前实现总是允许没有匹配规则的请求。"
  ],
  "correction": "改为最长匹配前缀优先，长度相同时仍采用输入中第一条。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for dev-acl: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "single",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "path": "/a/x",
          "rules": [
            {
              "prefix": "/a",
              "allow": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": true,
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "missing",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "path": "/x",
          "rules": []
        }
      },
      "expected": false,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "specific",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "path": "/a/private/x",
          "rules": [
            {
              "prefix": "/a",
              "allow": true
            },
            {
              "prefix": "/a/private",
              "allow": false
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": false,
      "public": true,
      "before": true
    },
    {
      "id": "specific-allow",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "path": "/a/b",
          "rules": [
            {
              "prefix": "/",
              "allow": false
            },
            {
              "prefix": "/a",
              "allow": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": true,
      "public": false,
      "before": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tie",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "path": "x",
          "rules": [
            {
              "prefix": "x",
              "allow": false
            },
            {
              "prefix": "x",
              "allow": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": false,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "empty-prefix",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": {
          "path": "abc",
          "rules": [
            {
              "prefix": "",
              "allow": false
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "expected": false,
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
